  "reason": "ot_hbm_hc_q_static registers every pin in RTL on the die schedule: lg_rr/lg_w_done/result*/result_v land in rr_q/w_done_q/result_q pin flops, the F20 bus (tgt, cfg*, desc*, launch_v) lands in ot_static_program_target's pin flops, lg_rq is an output register, lg_wq / x_wave* / gathered_mix* / done / status / fault leave leaf output registers; RD_CAPTURE 23 / GATHER_PHASE 23 / DONE_LAT 19 are fixed against these edges, so a kit flop stage would shift the compiler schedule"
 },
